    '**Chemical Spike Replenishment** — Rather than prematurely draining tens of liters of expensive ultra-pure chemicals, automated spike dosing injects precise concentrated chemical aliquots (V_spike) to compensate for volatile evaporation (such as NH₃ and HCl) and catalytic peroxide breakdown (H₂O₂).': '**Chemical Spike Replenishment** — Rather than prematurely draining tens of liters of expensive ultra-pure chemicals, automated spike dosing injects precise concentrated chemical aliquots (V_spike) to compensate for volatile evaporation (such as NH₃ and HCl) and catalytic peroxide breakdown (H₂O₂).',
